## UAV SAFETY DISCLAIMER

This Project involves unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) systems, radio-frequency
communications, telemetry systems, autonomous control software, embedded
electronics, and flight-related technologies.

Operation of UAVs involves inherent risks, including but not limited to:

• Personal injury
• Property damage
• Aircraft damage
• Communication failures
• GPS failures
• Software defects
• Hardware malfunctions
• Environmental hazards
• Regulatory violations

Users assume full responsibility for:

• Safe operation of any UAV utilizing this Project
• Compliance with local aviation laws
• Compliance with RF communication regulations
• Flight testing procedures
• Hardware validation
• Risk assessment and mitigation

The author does not certify the airworthiness, reliability, or safety of any
aircraft utilizing this Project.

